insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The passage implies that convenience may encourage people to use a service, but it does not guarantee satisfaction under careful supervision, as described in a policy review in a northern student forum context.','The passage argues that inconvenient services attract the most users.','The passage says convenience always guarantees satisfaction.','The passage suggests that a convenient service can attract users without necessarily satisfying them.','The passage denies that convenience affects service use.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The committee approved the plan only after several risks had been identified and addressed after initial trials, as described in a classroom discussion in a southern student forum context.','The committee rejected the plan because all risks were addressed.','The committee approved the plan before considering any risks.','The plan was accepted although no risks were identified.','The plan was accepted once the committee had dealt with the risks it found.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The decline in complaints was gradual, so managers were careful not to attribute it to a single change in schools, as described in a research summary in a central student forum context.','Because complaints decreased slowly, managers avoided saying that one change alone caused the improvement.','Managers ignored the decline because it was caused by one change.','The decline in complaints was sudden and easy to explain.','Managers blamed a single change because complaints rose quickly.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The writer contrasts short-term popularity with long-term reliability for adult learners, as described in a public debate in a online student forum context.','The writer discusses reliability without mentioning popularity.','The writer points out a difference between being popular now and being dependable over time.','The writer argues that long-term reliability is impossible.','The writer says popularity and reliability are exactly the same.','B','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'Although traffic cameras was initially criticized, later evidence showed that it could be useful when applied carefully in public institutions, as described in a training program.','Early criticism proved that traffic cameras had no value at all.','The usefulness of traffic cameras was accepted before anyone criticized it.','Later evidence suggested that traffic cameras, despite early criticism, may have value if used carefully.','Later evidence showed that traffic cameras should never be applied.','C','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'The report does not claim that renewable energy storage solves every problem; it argues only that it can reduce one specific difficulty during periods of change, as described in an evaluation report.','The report rejects the idea that renewable energy storage can help in any way.','The report discusses many solutions but never mentions a specific problem.','The report argues that renewable energy storage solves all problems completely.','According to the report, renewable energy storage is not a complete solution but may help with a particular problem.','D','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
insert into questions (type,difficulty,"questionText","choiceA","choiceB","choiceC","choiceD","correctAnswer","explanationHe",tags,"estimatedTimeSec","cefrLevel",status,"isPilot") values ('restatement',7,'Researchers postponed their recommendation because the available data were too limited to support a firm conclusion in small communities, as described in a committee meeting in a advanced student forum context.','The researchers delayed giving advice since the evidence was insufficient for a definite conclusion.','The researchers postponed collecting data after reaching a firm conclusion.','The researchers made a recommendation because the data were complete.','The available data forced the researchers to reject all conclusions.','A','התשובה הנכונה שומרת על משמעות המשפט המקורי בלי להוסיף או לסתור מידע.','["simulation_44", "restatement", "practice_pool"]'::jsonb,70,'C1','approved',false);
